Question	Answer
What is Sliding Window?	Flow control technique
What is window size?	Number of frames that can be sent at a time
What is Go-Back-N?	Error/loss recovery technique
What happens when a frame is lost?	Sender retransmits from that frame
What is ACK?	Acknowledgement
What is flow control?	Controls the rate of data transmission
What happens to the window after ACK?	It slides forward
